    "description": "Wooden bridge, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 143 blocks vs 96 (first build 115 vs 80). Wooden bridge, 3 wide and 11 long, oak deck on dark oak stringers and two spruce log trestle piers in the river, cobblestone abutments with two-step stair approaches, spruce fence rails; the water is a decoration step. L2 adds lanterns on the tall posts, wall cheeks and corbels; L3 banners at both ends, moss and flower pots. Piers stand at the water line here: in the world they must reach the river bed. Decoration step adds: water.",
